","path":"style.css"},{"content":"# Cloud Cargo

Cloud Cargo is an original deterministic cargo-allocation practice puzzle. Each manifest asks the player to partition the visible crates between airship bays. A crate has mass and energy; bays require exact totals. The first manifest uses mass, while later manifests require both resources.

## Play

Press **Start Loading**. With a keyboard, Left/Right moves the highlight and Space selects a crate or assigns the selected crate to a bay. On touch screens, tap a crate and then a bay. Exact full manifests verify briefly and dispatch automatically. Complete three airships before the 50-second dock window closes.

The board is generated deterministically from its GameKit seed, and replay uses the same seed for repeatable mastery. Device best is supplied by GameKit local practice state; this game does not use network services, accounts, or custom storage.

Pause and replay controls are provided by GameKit. Reduced-motion preference changes are observed during play and presentation keeps decorative effects static.
